    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><br><br><strong>Slay dino babies ... I guess? Well, as long as they're <i>Not the momma</i>!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037460/extras/bb96a4d0a4d5d96e02936783cf0545b6.poster.avif?t=1730368797\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037460/extras/bb96a4d0a4d5d96e02936783cf0545b6.webm?t=1730368797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037460/extras/bb96a4d0a4d5d96e02936783cf0545b6.mp4?t=1730368797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong>Use Sabres, a friendly talking airship to travel around in the 3 star solar system Omnia.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037460/extras/919689f635fff46cd2b5e34db1ec82e4.poster.avif?t=1730368797\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037460/extras/919689f635fff46cd2b5e34db1ec82e4.webm?t=1730368797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037460/extras/919689f635fff46cd2b5e34db1ec82e4.mp4?t=1730368797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Burn those poisonous plants! But be careful not breathing in the spores ...</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037460/extras/7cb70cabcf7bb8203d33dd194d7697b9.poster.avif?t=1730368797\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1037460/extras/7cb70cabcf7bb8203d33dd194d7697b9.webm?t=1730368797\" type=\"video/webm; 